<title>HONG KONG: GOLF-FINAL RESULTS IN THE ALFRED DUNHILL MASTERS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL RESULTS IN THE ALFRED DUNHILL MASTERS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the fourth</p>
<p>round of the $500,000 Alfred Dunhill Masters golf on Sunday:</p>
<p>267 Bernhard Langer (Germany) 66 67 69 65</p>
<p>269 Kang Wook-soon (South Korea) 64 70 69 66</p>
<p>270 Scott Laycock (Australia) 66 68 65 71</p>
<p>271 Boonchu Ruangkit (Thailand) 67 67 67 70</p>
<p>273 Stephen Leaney (Australia) 70 64 68 71</p>
<p>274 Ernie Els (South Africa) 71 69 66 68, Scott Taylor (U.S.)</p>
<p>67 69 68 70</p>
<p>275 Greg Chalmers (Australia) 70 66 71 68, Richard Kaplan</p>
<p>(South Africa) 72 66 66 71, Hsieh Yu-shu (Taiwan) 67 66 68 74</p>
<p>276 Dominique Boulet (Hong Kong) 71 71 67 67, Craig Kamps</p>
<p>(South Africa) 71 65 71 69, Chris Gray (Australia) 71 68 66 71,</p>
<p>Justin Cooper (Australia) 69 67 68 72</p>
<p>277 Aaron Meeks (U.S.) 66 68 73 70, Peter McWhinney (Australia)</p>
<p>71 67 70 69, Shane Tait (Australia) 69 69 69 70</p>
<p>278 Darren Cole (Australia) 67 70 69 72</p>
